# M1's hover check, on the C3 sidebar since M5a: the pointer onto row a's name, the first row of
# the Transform card, whose box is (49, 402.5, 394, 44) at 1440 x 900 (the reference's DOM). One
# frame later that row is lit (its band, its name in --foreground, its box's stroke at 2 px) and
# nothing outside it has changed; on the reference the same point lights the same row.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
shot rest
move 200 424
wait 16
shot hover
